{"timestamp": 1779397088.6939871, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Diana dead in Electrical, right near the task area. My route was Security \u2192 Navigation \u2192 back to Security \u2192 Electrical. I saw Bob enter Security from Weapons at tick 1. Then I saw Charlie in Navigation around tick 3, and Charlie left Navigation toward Security at tick 4; I later saw Charlie in Security around tick 8. I didn\u2019t see anyone else in Electrical when I found the body, and I didn\u2019t see Diana alive earlier. No hard accusation from me yet, just reporting the location and my route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779397103.105738, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in Navigation, then went through Security and ended up in Weapons. I saw Alice enter Navigation from Security around tick 3, and she was still in Navigation around tick 4, so that part of her route matches what I saw. I did not see Diana alive at all, and I never went into Electrical, so I didn\u2019t see the body.\n\nLater around tick 8 I saw Alice moving around the Security/Electrical side \u2014 I saw her at Security and heading toward Electrical, which lines up with her finding the body there. So Alice\u2019s story is consistent with my vision so far. I don\u2019t have a hard suspect yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779397119.82594, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine. Important detail: I saw Diana alive in Electrical at tick 4. At that same time, I saw Bob enter Electrical from Security, and Diana had just come into Electrical from Medbay. Then at tick 6 I saw Bob leave Electrical into Medbay, and I saw him in Medbay through ticks 6-8.\n\nSo if Diana\u2019s body was found in Electrical, Bob definitely had opportunity between tick 4 and tick 6. Alice and Charlie\u2019s stories line up with each other pretty well, and Alice finding the body later in Electrical makes sense. I\u2019m not hard-locking yet because I want to hear Bob explain, but Bob is the main sus from what I saw."}}
{"timestamp": 1779397128.0157208, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I was nowhere near Electrical this round. My route was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 back through Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine, and I didn\u2019t see anyone at all, so I can\u2019t directly clear or accuse anyone from vision.\n\nFrom the info so far, Alice and Charlie seem to line up on the Security/Navigation side. Eve\u2019s info is the strongest: Diana was alive in Electrical at tick 4, Bob entered Electrical around then, and Bob left toward Medbay by tick 6. If the body was found in Electrical, that gives Bob the clearest opportunity window right now.\n\nI want to hear Bob\u2019s explanation, but based on current info Bob is definitely my top suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779397142.6315231, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Whoa, hold on a second Eve, that is a massive spin on what actually happened. Yes, my route was Weapons -> Security -> Electrical -> Medbay. But you're conveniently leaving out a huge detail: when I walked into Electrical, I saw YOU and Diana there together. \n\nI didn't stay in Electrical; I just passed through and went straight to Medbay to do my task. When I left Electrical, Diana was alive and alone with YOU. And what happened next? You followed me right into Medbay immediately after! You were the last person with Diana in Electrical. It makes perfect sense that you killed her and then rushed into Medbay to use me as your alibi, and now you're trying to strike first and frame me because you know I saw you with the victim. \n\nAlice and Charlie's stories check out, and Frank was far away. This is 100% Eve trying to cover her tracks. I'm voting Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779398143.73678, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": ""}}
{"timestamp": 1779399144.067848, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": ""}}
{"timestamp": 1779399166.324404, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob\u2019s story doesn\u2019t match my vision. I was already in Medbay when I saw Bob enter Medbay from Electrical at tick 6, and then I saw him there through ticks 6-8. So the claim that he \u201cleft Diana alive alone with me in Electrical\u201d and that I followed him in immediately is not what happened from my view.\n\nThe solid facts I have are: Diana was alive in Electrical at tick 4, Bob entered Electrical from Security at tick 4, then Bob came out of Electrical into Medbay at tick 6. Diana\u2019s body was later found in Electrical. That\u2019s the cleanest opportunity window we have.\n\nBob accusing me makes sense if he\u2019s trying to flip the sus, but his version adds details that don\u2019t line up with what I saw. I\u2019m still strongly on Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779399184.034475, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I still have no direct vision on this \u2014 I was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine and saw nobody.\n\nBut from the discussion, the only real conflict is Bob vs Eve. Alice reported in Electrical, and Alice/Charlie seem consistent on the Security/Navigation side. Eve gave the timeline first: Diana alive in Electrical at tick 4, Bob enters Electrical, then Bob comes out toward Medbay by tick 6. Bob confirms he was in Electrical during that window, but his defense depends on claiming Diana was alive when he left and that Eve followed him \u2014 which Eve directly disputes.\n\nTo me, Bob has the clearest confirmed opportunity, and his counter-accusation feels like trying to flip the pressure. Unless the last speaker has something major, I\u2019m leaning Bob here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779399209.021645, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice, Charlie, please look at this objectively. Frank says I have the \"clearest opportunity\", but look back at Eve's very first statement! She literally admitted she was in Electrical with Diana at tick 4. We both had the exact same window of opportunity. The only difference is that she got to speak first and set the narrative.\n\nShe killed Diana in Electrical, bolted to Medbay, and when I walked through her crime scene right around the same time, she realized she had the perfect scapegoat. She's locking onto me so hard because it's a 1v1 and she needs to eliminate the only person who can place her at the scene of the crime. \n\nIt is a classic frame job. You two (Alice and Charlie) are the deciding votes here. If you vote me based on a 50/50 he-said-she-said, you're handing the Duck a free elimination. I am voting Eve because I know for a fact she's lying about the sequence of events. If you aren't completely sure, skip, but do not let her get away with this framing.\n\nEve"}}
